  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:08.770" end="00:10.720" ttm:agent="v1">She keeps on texting me</p>
      <p begin="00:10.720" end="00:13.120" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? No, definitely</p>
      <p begin="00:13.120" end="00:14.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="00:14.840" end="00:17.070" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="00:17.070" end="00:18.770" ttm:agent="v1">She keeps on texting me</p>
      <p begin="00:18.770" end="00:21.190" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? No, definitely</p>
      <p begin="00:21.190" end="00:23.180" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="00:23.180" end="00:25.720" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="00:25.720" end="00:28.320" ttm:agent="v1">I keep on dovin' and lovin' and lovin'</p>
      <p begin="00:28.320" end="00:29.880" ttm:agent="v1">Na-na, dee-dees</p>
      <p begin="00:29.880" end="00:31.980" ttm:agent="v1">She said I smell too good</p>
      <p begin="00:31.980" end="00:34.100" ttm:agent="v1">Da-da-da, da-da-vee-dee</p>
      <p begin="00:34.100" end="00:35.700" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="00:35.700" end="00:38.260" ttm:agent="v1">I kiss like Bethany</p>
      <p begin="00:38.260" end="00:40.230" ttm:agent="v1">I think we're meant to be</p>
      <p begin="00:40.230" end="00:42.460" ttm:agent="v1">But I fucked up, definitely</p>
      <p begin="00:42.460" end="00:44.120" ttm:agent="v1">She keeps on texting me</p>
      <p begin="00:44.120" end="00:46.550" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? No, definitely</p>
      <p begin="00:46.550" end="00:48.450" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="00:48.450" end="00:50.680" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="00:50.680" end="00:52.570" ttm:agent="v1">She keeps on texting me</p>
      <p begin="00:52.570" end="00:54.960" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? No, definitely</p>
      <p begin="00:54.960" end="00:56.770" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="00:56.770" end="00:59.560" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="00:59.560" end="01:01.220" ttm:agent="v1">I'm dovin' and lovin'</p>
      <p begin="01:01.220" end="01:03.710" ttm:agent="v1">I don't even have to stay</p>
      <p begin="01:03.710" end="01:05.450" ttm:agent="v1">I'm dovin' and lovin'</p>
      <p begin="01:05.450" end="01:07.540" ttm:agent="v1">I don't need accolades</p>
      <p begin="01:07.540" end="01:09.580" ttm:agent="v1">I miss you, Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="01:09.580" end="01:12.460" ttm:agent="v1">I kissed like Bethany and Devany</p>
      <p begin="01:12.460" end="01:14.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Bro, how many did you kiss?)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.090" end="01:15.820" ttm:agent="v1">Her name's not Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="01:15.820" end="01:17.680" ttm:agent="v1">She keeps on texting me</p>
      <p begin="01:17.680" end="01:20.030" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? No, definitely</p>
      <p begin="01:20.030" end="01:22.080" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="01:22.080" end="01:24.250" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="01:24.250" end="01:26.130" ttm:agent="v1">She keeps on texting me</p>
      <p begin="01:26.130" end="01:28.370" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? No, definitely</p>
      <p begin="01:28.370" end="01:30.370" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just like Stephanie</p>
      <p begin="01:30.370" end="01:32.750" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="01:32.750" end="01:35.560" ttm:agent="v1">I keep on dovin' and lovin' and lovin'</p>
      <p begin="01:35.560" end="01:39.160" ttm:agent="v1">Na-na, dee-dees</p>
      <p begin="01:39.160" end="01:41.250" ttm:agent="v1">Don't know if I'll see you again</p>
      <p begin="01:41.250" end="01:43.160" ttm:agent="v1">I can't keep playin' pretend</p>
      <p begin="01:43.160" end="01:47.220" ttm:agent="v1">Don't know if I'll see you again</p>
      <p begin="01:47.220" end="01:49.390" ttm:agent="v1">Do I like her? Yeah, 'specially</p>
      <p begin="01:49.390" end="01:53.430" ttm:agent="v1">I think we should all just jump on to this show</p>
      <p begin="01:53.430" end="01:58.450" ttm:agent="v1">And put away our problems, or whatever it is</p>
      <p begin="01:58.450" end="02:01.540" ttm:agent="v1">We just need to forget about everything</p>
